-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §54 מיצוי תביעות: the agreement exhausts the
-- parties' claims on what it settles and on economic demands that would
-- raise the cost of employing teaching employees, subject to §56; to
-- 31.12.2016, save the change in the structure of the work and the
-- consideration for the move to the reform, which it exhausts outright;
-- not the organisation's economic claims for the period from 1.1.2017; the
-- erosion supplement of §39 exhausts every demand over erosion against the
-- engineers, whose agreements are cancelled; the reform's supplements add
-- to 51.35%; a merger of general components is to be discussed once the
-- reform is in full everywhere; and the understandings are one whole.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `oz-founding-38`
IMPORT `oz-founding-39`

§ `54 מיצוי תביעות`

DECLARE `Oz section 54 action` IS ONE OF
    `discuss merging general salary components without raising the cost`

-- What a claim may be about, as §54 tells claims apart.
DECLARE `matter of an Oz claim` IS ONE OF
    `a matter the Oz agreement settles`
    `an economic demand raising the cost of employing the teaching employees`
    `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform`
    `the cost of a public-sector framework agreement`
    `compensation for the erosion of teachers' pay against the engineers'`

§§ `54(א)–(ד)`

-- (א): the agreement fully and finally exhausts the parties' claims on the
-- matters it settles; no further negotiation is held on them, nor on
-- economic demands that would raise the cost of employing the teaching
-- employees (§4(א)), subject to §56. (ג) repeats that (א) and (ב) are
-- subject to §56: the cost of a framework agreement is §56's, not
-- exhausted here.
-- (ב): save the matters connected with the change in the structure of the
-- teachers' work itself and the consideration for the move to the reform's
-- terms — which are within (א)'s exhaustion — the exhaustion runs to
-- 31.12.2016 (the day included: convention dates.end). The claim is
-- placed by the period it is for.
-- (ד): (א) and (ב) do not exhaust the organisation's economic claims for
-- the period from 1.1.2017 (convention dates.start), wage supplements of
-- every kind for that period among them, "בין היתר עבור תנאי העבודה של
-- המורה כפי שהינם במועד העלאת הדרישה הכלכלית".
--
-- F-oz-founding-54-a: an economic claim for a period from 1.1.2017 that
-- asks pay for the work as the reform shaped it is, by (ב)'s words, a
-- matter connected with the change in the work's structure, exhausted
-- with no end; and by (ד)'s words a claim (א) and (ב) do not exhaust. The
-- reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): (ד), which speaks of
-- the claims for that period and opens by setting (א) and (ב) aside.
@ref akn:art_54__para_a akn:art_54__para_b akn:art_54__para_c akn:art_54__para_d
`the last day section 54(ב) exhausts claims for` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2016
`the first day section 54(ד) keeps claims open for` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017

GIVEN m IS A `matter of an Oz claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an economic claim under section 54` m IF
        m EQUALS `a matter the Oz agreement settles`
    OR m EQUALS `an economic demand raising the cost of employing the teaching employees`
    OR m EQUALS `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform`

-- (א) and (ב), by their words.
GIVEN m IS A `matter of an Oz claim`, `the period it is for begins on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 54(א)–(ב) exhaust` m `the period it is for begins on` IF
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a matter the Oz agreement settles` THEN `the period it is for begins on` `is on or before` `the last day section 54(ב) exhausts claims for`
    WHEN `an economic demand raising the cost of employing the teaching employees` THEN `the period it is for begins on` `is on or before` `the last day section 54(ב) exhausts claims for`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- (ד), by its words.
GIVEN m IS A `matter of an Oz claim`, `the period it is for begins on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 54(ד) keeps open` m `the period it is for begins on` IF
        `an economic claim under section 54` m
    AND `the period it is for begins on` `is on or after` `the first day section 54(ד) keeps claims open for`

-- (א)–(ה) together, by F-oz-founding-54-a's reading: the framework
-- agreements' cost is §56's ((ג)); erosion against the engineers is
-- exhausted by (ה), with no end; the rest by (א)–(ב), save what (ד) keeps
-- open.
GIVEN m IS A `matter of an Oz claim`, `the period it is for begins on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exhausted under section 54` m `the period it is for begins on` IF
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN `the cost of a public-sector framework agreement` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `compensation for the erosion of teachers' pay against the engineers'` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE `section 54(א)–(ב) exhaust` m `the period it is for begins on`
              AND NOT `section 54(ד) keeps open` m `the period it is for begins on`

§§ `54(ה)–(ו)`

-- (ה): the erosion supplement of §39 fully and finally exhausts every
-- demand for compensation for the erosion of teaching employees' pay
-- against the engineers'. (ו): from the signing (14.8.2011; convention
-- dates.start) every provision of the collective agreements on that
-- erosion is cancelled, the erosion checks and the compensation for it
-- among them.
@ref akn:art_54__para_e akn:art_54__para_f
`the day section 54(ו) cancels the erosion provisions from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 14 8 2011

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an erosion provision against the engineers stands under section 54(ו) on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the day section 54(ו) cancels the erosion provisions from`

`the supplement section 54(ה) says exhausts the erosion demands` MEANS `the erosion supplement rate`

§§ `54(ז)`

-- (ז): for the avoidance of doubt, the whole rate of the supplement given
-- for the Oz LaTmura reform, for the erosion of 2008–2010 and the
-- supplement the framework agreement set is, with the reform in full,
-- "2.1% + 7.25% + 42% = 51.35%": §39's erosion supplement, §38's 2011
-- supplement at its last rate (from 1.7.2013), and §16's Oz LaTmura
-- supplement. The sum is checked against those sections' own rates.
@ref akn:art_54__para_g
`the whole rate section 54(ז) states` MEANS 51.35%

`the rates section 54(ז) adds up` MEANS
    `the erosion supplement rate`
    PLUS `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013)
    PLUS `the Oz LaTmura supplement rate`

§§ `54(ח)`

-- (ח): once the reform is applied in full in all the schools, the parties
-- discuss merging general salary components, without raising the cost. A
-- duty to discuss, not to merge; no day is set (convention
-- dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_54__para_h
GIVEN `the reform is applied in full in all the schools` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz section 54 action`
DECIDE `discussing a merger of general components` `the reform is applied in full in all the schools` IS
    IF `the reform is applied in full in all the schools`
    THEN (PARTY `the employer`
          MUST  `discuss merging general salary components without raising the cost`)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
          MUST  `discuss merging general salary components without raising the cost`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `the cost before the merger` IS A NUMBER, `the cost after the merger` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a merger section 54(ח) speaks of` `the cost before the merger` `the cost after the merger` IF
    `the cost after the merger` AT MOST `the cost before the merger`

§§ `54(ט)`

-- (ט): all the understandings on the Oz LaTmura reform, at every stage,
-- are bound together, one whole, and cannot be separated.
@ref akn:art_54__para_i
`the Oz understandings can be separated` MEANS FALSE

§§ `54 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `exhausted under section 54` `an economic demand raising the cost of employing the teaching employees` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2015)
#ASSERT NOT `exhausted under section 54` `an economic demand raising the cost of employing the teaching employees` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017)
#ASSERT NOT `exhausted under section 54` `the cost of a public-sector framework agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
#ASSERT `exhausted under section 54` `compensation for the erosion of teachers' pay against the engineers'` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2020)
#ASSERT `exhausted under section 54` `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2016)
#ASSERT NOT `an erosion provision against the engineers stands under section 54(ו) on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 14 8 2011)
#ASSERT `an erosion provision against the engineers stands under section 54(ו) on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 13 8 2011)
-- (ז)'s sum is right, and is the three sections' own rates
#ASSERT `the rates section 54(ז) adds up` EQUALS `the whole rate section 54(ז) states`
#ASSERT `discussing a merger of general components` FALSE EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT `a merger section 54(ח) speaks of` 100 100 AND NOT `a merger section 54(ח) speaks of` 100 101

-- F-oz-founding-54-a's evidence: a claim for 2017 on pay for the work the
-- reform shaped is exhausted by (ב)'s words and kept open by (ד)'s.
`sections 54(ב) and 54(ד) both reach a claim for 2017 on the reform's work` MEANS
        `section 54(א)–(ב) exhaust` `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017)
    AND `section 54(ד) keeps open` `the change in the structure of the teachers' work, or the consideration for the move to the reform` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017)
#ASSERT `sections 54(ב) and 54(ד) both reach a claim for 2017 on the reform's work`
